    "選択したノート・PDFの本文、文字認識した本文、タイトル、ページ番号をCloudflareへ送信します。CloudflareのAIで検索用データを作成し、質問との関連度を評価します。本文と検索用データは資料の検索データ削除またはアカウント削除まで保存されます。検索時には質問もCloudflareへ送り、曖昧な質問では直前の質問も検索に使います。検索で見つかった抜粋は回答のためGoogle Geminiへ送信します。保護されたノートは対象外です。" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the data that is sent to Cloudflare for search purposes.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The text, recognized text, title, and page numbers of selected notebooks and PDFs are sent to Cloudflare. Cloudflare AI creates search data and evaluates relevance to your question. Text and search data are stored until you delete the document’s search data or your account. Search questions are also sent to Cloudflare; an ambiguous question may use your previous question as well. Retrieved excerpts are sent to Google Gemini to generate an answer. Protected notebooks are excluded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
